## UserAccountApi

### List following boards
## List following boards
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/user_account/following/boards?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}&explicitFollowing={{explicitFollowing}}&bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json

### Follow user
## Follow user
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/user_account/following/{{username}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "auto_follow": "<string>"
}


### List followers
## List followers
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/user_account/followers?bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json

### List linked businesses
## List linked businesses
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/user_account/businesses
Accept: application/json

### Unverify website
## Unverify website
DELETE https://api.pinterest.com/v5/user_account/websites?website={{website}}
Accept: application/json

### Get user account analytics
## Get user account analytics
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/user_account/analytics?startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}&fromClaimedContent={{fromClaimedContent}}&pinFormat={{pinFormat}}&appTypes={{appTypes}}&contentType={{contentType}}&source={{source}}&metricTypes={{metricTypes}}&splitField={{splitField}}&adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Accept: application/json

### Get user account top pins analytics
## Get user account top pins analytics
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/user_account/analytics/top_pins?startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}&sortBy={{sortBy}}&fromClaimedContent={{fromClaimedContent}}&pinFormat={{pinFormat}}&appTypes={{appTypes}}&contentType={{contentType}}&source={{source}}&metricTypes={{metricTypes}}&numOfPins={{numOfPins}}&createdInLastNDays={{createdInLastNDays}}&adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Accept: application/json

### Get user account top video pins analytics
## Get user account top video pins analytics
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/user_account/analytics/top_video_pins?startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}&sortBy={{sortBy}}&fromClaimedContent={{fromClaimedContent}}&pinFormat={{pinFormat}}&appTypes={{appTypes}}&contentType={{contentType}}&source={{source}}&metricTypes={{metricTypes}}&numOfPins={{numOfPins}}&createdInLastNDays={{createdInLastNDays}}&adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Accept: application/json

### List following interests
## List following interests
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/users/{{username}}/interests/follow?bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json

### Get user account
## Get user account
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/user_account?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Accept: application/json

### List following
## List following
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/user_account/following?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}&explicitFollowing={{explicitFollowing}}&feedType={{feedType}}&bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json

### Get user websites
## Get user websites
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/user_account/websites?bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json

### Verify website
## Verify website
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/user_account/websites?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "verification_method": "<string>",
 "website": "<string>"
}


### Get user verification code for website claiming
## Get user verification code for website claiming
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/user_account/websites/verification?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Accept: application/json
